1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Lose a leg at 4 s: how long can the robot wait before it reacts?  Simulation only (MuJoCo, seeds 0-9). No hardware.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
One robot: NORMAL, FAULT, DIAGNOSED, STANDING + REPLANNING, WALKING

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Detect the failed legs, stand, search a new gait with CMA-ES, switch

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Same fault, same 10 seeds: plain tripod makes no net progress, re-planned gait walks in 7 of 10 and falls in 2

5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Recovered share falls from 55% at 0 s delay to 15% at 1.5 s

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Recovered: plain tripod 0, final controller 6, offline oracle 15 of 21
